<title>SLOVAKIA: TABLE-Slovak cbank forex reserve $2.937bln July 30.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Slovak cbank forex reserve $2.937bln July 30.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia</p>
<p>(NBS) said on Friday its hard currency reserves totalled $2.937</p>
<p>billion as of July 30, down from $2.958 billion on July 23.</p>
<p>  SLOVAK FOREX RESERVES   July 30  July 23   July 17  Dec 31/96</p>
<p>   NBS reserves ($bln)     2.937    2.958     2.999    3.473</p>
<p>   Commercial banks	  3.602    3.617     3.671    2.321</p>
<p>   Entire banking sector   6.539    6.575     6.671    5.794</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
